{"headword":"רָפָה³","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"II. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָפָא</span> as <strong>n.pr.m.</strong>, always c. art. Hā-Rāphā <strong>(</strong>perhaps der. from n.pr.gent. II. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְפָאִים</span>, q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">הָֽרָפָה</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.16\">2 S 21:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">18</a>, c. prep. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהָ׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.22\">20:22</a> = <span dir=\"rtl\">לְהָרָפָא</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.6\">1 Ch 20:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.8\">8</a>;—only as parent, <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּילִידֵי הָר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.16\">2 S 21:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.18\">18</a> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">מִילִידֵי הָֽרְפָאִים</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.4\">1 Ch 20:4</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יֻלַּד לְהָר׳</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 21:22\" href=\"/II_Samuel.21.22\">22</a> ‖ <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.6\">I Ch 20:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 20:8\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.20.8\">8</a>.—1. <span dir=\"rtl\">רָפָה</span> v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, רָפָא\" href=\"/BDB,_רָפָא\", dir=\"rtl\">רָפָא</a>."}]},"rid":"BDB09491","strong_numbers":["7498","7503","7510","7495","7498"],"next_hw":"רְפָאִים²","prev_hw":"רִפָּיוֹן","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"II.","quotes":[],"GK":["8332","8334","8335","8324","8325"],"TWOT":["2198","2198b","2196"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lex